{"data":{"id":1400570838,"totalResults":63,"items":[{"quote":"From Software upped the ante, surpassing even their best efforts that we saw with Sekiro Shadows Die Twice in terms of world building.  Elden Ring is an absolute must-play game for 2022, but set aside some time and some patience.","score":100,"url":"https://attackofthefanboy.com/reviews/elden-ring-review/","date":"2022-03-09","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"Attack of the Fanboy","publicationSlug":"attack-of-the-fanboy","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400570838,"type":"games","title":"Elden Ring","url":"/game/elden-ring/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/elden-ring/critic-reviews/?platform=pc","score":94},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400570838,"name":"Elden Ring"},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"}}},"platform":"PC"},{"quote":"In a genre that has become wrought with bloated and over-designed games, Elden Ring is defiantly contrarian in almost every way. Its commitment to design by subtraction and to placing the responsibility of charting a path through its world entirely on the player makes it stand head and shoulders above other open-world titles. Elden Ring takes the shards of what came before and forges them into something that will go down in history as one of the all-time greats: a triumph in design and creativity, and an open-world game that distinguishes itself for what it doesn't do as much as what it does.\r\n","score":100,"url":"https://www.gamespot.com/reviews/elden-ring-review-in-progress-death-of-the-wild/1900-6417832/","date":"2022-02-23","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"GameSpot","publicationSlug":"gamespot","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400570838,"type":"games","title":"Elden Ring","url":"/game/elden-ring/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/elden-ring/critic-reviews/?platform=pc","score":94},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400570838,"name":"Elden Ring"},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"}}},"platform":"PC"},{"quote":"Elden Ring is one of the best games in years, with a breathtaking vast world to explore, and one of the most satisfying combat systems in an RPG. This is the accumulation of FromSoftware’s work over the last thirteen years and an evolution on its inspiring formula.\r\n","score":100,"url":"https://hardcoregamer.com/reviews/review-elden-ring/419425/","date":"2022-02-23","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"Hardcore Gamer","publicationSlug":"hardcore-gamer","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400570838,"type":"games","title":"Elden Ring","url":"/game/elden-ring/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/elden-ring/critic-reviews/?platform=pc","score":94},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400570838,"name":"Elden Ring"},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"}}},"platform":"PC"},{"quote":"Naysayers will point to reused assets, a lowering of the difficulty in Spirit Summons, but these people miss the point. Elden Ring is the definitive Souls experience, introducing a class-leading open-world design and mechanics that will draw more people to the franchise. And that’s nothing but a good thing.\r\n","score":100,"url":"https://www.heypoorplayer.com/2022/02/23/elden-ring-review-pc/","date":"2022-02-23","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"Hey Poor Player","publicationSlug":"hey-poor-player","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400570838,"type":"games","title":"Elden Ring","url":"/game/elden-ring/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/elden-ring/critic-reviews/?platform=pc","score":94},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400570838,"name":"Elden Ring"},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"}}},"platform":"PC"},{"quote":"Although challenging and grand, Elden Ring brilliantly immerses players in its fantasy world. The game rewards every type of player, from the curious explorer to the action-hungry warrior; you'll find something to love about this game. Even after 30 hours, there are still many adventures that await me in The Lands Between. This is an evolution of every Soulslike game that came before, and although brutally challenging, I couldn't put it down for a second.\r\n","score":100,"url":"https://noisypixel.net/elden-ring-review-pc-ps4-ps5-xbox-one-series-x/","date":"2022-02-23","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"Noisy Pixel","publicationSlug":"noisy-pixel","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400570838,"type":"games","title":"Elden Ring","url":"/game/elden-ring/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/elden-ring/critic-reviews/?platform=pc","score":94},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400570838,"name":"Elden Ring"},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"}}},"platform":"PC"},{"quote":"As an open-world skeptic who was pretty much convinced that the Souls formula wouldn't work in such a setting, I'm happy to have been proven wrong. Elden Ring retains the heart of what makes FromSoft's action RPGs so compelling, and takes things to a whole other level by pulling the best elements from their older games and improving upon them in this one.\r\n","score":100,"url":"https://twinfinite.net/2022/02/elden-ring-review","date":"2022-02-23","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"Twinfinite","publicationSlug":"twinfinite","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400570838,"type":"games","title":"Elden Ring","url":"/game/elden-ring/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/elden-ring/critic-reviews/?platform=pc","score":94},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400570838,"name":"Elden Ring"},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"}}},"platform":"PC"},{"quote":"Elden Ring is not only the best action RPG developed by From Software but one of the best open-world titles ever made. A masterclass of game design, Elden Ring isn't just a game but an epic dark fantasy journey that no one will be able to forget for a very long time.\r\n","score":100,"url":"https://wccftech.com/review/elden-ring-make-way-for-the-elden-lord/","date":"2022-02-23","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"Wccftech","publicationSlug":"wccftech","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400570838,"type":"games","title":"Elden Ring","url":"/game/elden-ring/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/elden-ring/critic-reviews/?platform=pc","score":94},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400570838,"name":"Elden Ring"},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"}}},"platform":"PC"},{"quote":"Elden Ring is a marvel with scope and diversity of mind-boggling proportions. At the risk of hyperbole, it has dethroned Bloodborne as my favorite game of all time. It's all I've been able to think about since I got my hands on it, and the only thing I want to do now is play it with the rest of you.\r\n","score":100,"url":"https://wegotthiscovered.com/gaming/elden-ring-review-pc/","date":"2022-02-23","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"We Got This Covered","publicationSlug":"we-got-this-covered","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400570838,"type":"games","title":"Elden Ring","url":"/game/elden-ring/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/elden-ring/critic-reviews/?platform=pc","score":94},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400570838,"name":"Elden Ring"},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"}}},"platform":"PC"},{"quote":"Backed by an incredible and rewarding open-world design, Elden Ring is a masterclass in every facet that it brings to the table. Without a doubt, this is FromSoftware’s magnum opus.\r\n","score":100,"url":"https://www.well-played.com.au/elden-ring-review/","date":"2022-02-23","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"WellPlayed","publicationSlug":"wellplayed","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400570838,"type":"games","title":"Elden Ring","url":"/game/elden-ring/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/elden-ring/critic-reviews/?platform=pc","score":94},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400570838,"name":"Elden Ring"},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"}}},"platform":"PC"},{"quote":"A supercut of FromSoft's very best work, transported to a totally new space. Elden Ring is not only a masterpiece by its developer's lofty standards, but in packing so much density into the Lands Between, it lights the path ahead for open-world games in general.","score":100,"url":"https://www.pcgamesn.com/elden-ring/review-pc","date":"2022-02-23","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"PCGamesN","publicationSlug":"pcgamesn","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400570838,"type":"games","title":"Elden Ring","url":"/game/elden-ring/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/elden-ring/critic-reviews/?platform=pc","score":94},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400570838,"name":"Elden Ring"},"platform":{"id":1533000068,"name":"PC"}}},"platform":"PC"}]},"links":{"self":{"href":"https://backend.metacritic.com/reviews/metacritic/critic/games/elden-ring/platform/pc/web?offset=0&limit=10&filterBySentiment=all&sort=score"},"prev":{"href":null},"next":{"href":"https://backend.metacritic.com/reviews/metacritic/critic/games/elden-ring/platform/pc/web?offset=10&limit=10&filterBySentiment=all&sort=score"},"first":{"href":"https://backend.metacritic.com/reviews/metacritic/critic/games/elden-ring/platform/pc/web?offset=0&limit=10&filterBySentiment=all&sort=score"},"last":{"href":"https://backend.metacritic.com/reviews/metacritic/critic/games/elden-ring/platform/pc/web?offset=60&limit=10&filterBySentiment=all&sort=score"},"filterOptions":[{"label":"All Reviews","value":"all","href":"https://backend.metacritic.com/reviews/metacritic/critic/games/elden-ring/platform/pc/web?offset=0&limit=10&filterBySentiment=all&sort=score"},{"label":"Positive Reviews","value":"positive","href":"https://backend.metacritic.com/reviews/metacritic/critic/games/el